Copyright (c) Musiku contributors

The lyric view in musiku-rs/ui-src/desktop/SpicyLyrics.jsx and
musiku-rs/ui-src/desktop/spicy-lyrics.css is an original reimplementation for
Musiku, inspired by Spicy Lyrics by Spikerko:

    https://github.com/Spikerko/spicy-lyrics

Spicy Lyrics is licensed under AGPL-3.0. No source code from that repository
was copied into Musiku; only the visual behaviour was used as a reference.

Lyrics continue to come from Musiku's existing sources (LRCLIB / YouTube Music)
through /api/lyrics/[id]. Musiku remains MIT-licensed.
